{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29311","headline":"令狐舍人说昨夜西掖翫月因戏赠 · 李商隐","name":"令狐舍人说昨夜西掖翫月因戏赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨夜玉轮明，传闻近太清。\n凉波冲碧瓦，晓晕落金茎。\n露索秦宫井，风弦汉殿筝。\n几时緜竹颂，拟荐子虚名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29311.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29311","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}